{"version":1,"id":"the-kid-laroi-so-done","title":"So Done","artist":"The Kid LAROI","key":"Em","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/the-kid-laroi/so-done/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Illevin, The Kid Laroi and Dominic Bucks","chords":[{"symbol":"F#m","canonical":"F#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[6,9,1],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"A","canonical":"A","keyboardPitchClasses":[9,1,4],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"E","canonical":"E","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,8,11],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Bm7","canonical":"Bm7","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,2,6,9],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"instrumental","text":"[Intro]","columns":22,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":13,"beat":2},{"symbol":"E","column":16,"beat":4},{"symbol":"Bm7","column":19,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"Okay, I realize now, that everything that I did was wrong","columns":57,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":12,"beat":2},{"symbol":"E","column":27,"beat":4},{"symbol":"Bm7","column":52,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"Okay, I realize now, some things are better off said than done","columns":62,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":12,"beat":2},{"symbol":"E","column":27,"beat":4},{"symbol":"Bm7","column":56,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"Okay, I realize now, that maybe I'm not ready for love","columns":55,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":12,"beat":2},{"symbol":"E","column":27,"beat":4},{"symbol":"Bm7","column":52,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"Okay, I realize now, I finished us before we begun-un-un","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":12,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm done, so done, I'm done with all the games you play","columns":55,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":13,"beat":2},{"symbol":"E","column":24,"beat":4},{"symbol":"Bm7","column":47,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm numb, so numb, I'm numb to all the pain you bring","columns":53,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":13,"beat":2},{"symbol":"E","column":24,"beat":4},{"symbol":"Bm7","column":44,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm tryna figure this all out for myself","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":27,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"I don't need you or nobody else, I'm done, so done","columns":50,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bm7","column":20,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F#m","column":35,"beat":4},{"symbol":"A","column":47,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"So done, so done, so done, so done, I'm done","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bm7","column":20,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"(Oh no, no-no-no, no-no-no)","columns":27,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":6,"beat":2},{"symbol":"E","column":10,"beat":4},{"symbol":"Bm7","column":20,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"I think that it's time for you to realize","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":17,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"That I'm not gon' be here forever but I","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":16,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"Wish that I was, but you were the cause","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":13,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"For every lil' feelin' I'm feeling inside","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm7","column":14,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"Sometimes I sit and I think about why","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":12,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"I even trusted you, shit, unsurprised","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":7,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm walkin' away from you, it's about time","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":11,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"Want you to walk out and walk out of my life","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm7","column":11,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"And you, yeah, you (yeah, you)","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":17,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"You stay on my mind way more than I would like for you to","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":19,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bm7","column":41,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"And you, yeah, you","columns":18,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":16,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"The reason I can't find no love, don't wanna find no one","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":19,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bm7","column":45,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"'Cause I'm done, so done, I'm done with all the games you play","columns":62,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":22,"beat":2},{"symbol":"E","column":35,"beat":4},{"symbol":"Bm7","column":56,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm numb, so numb, I'm numb to all the pain you bring","columns":53,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":15,"beat":2},{"symbol":"E","column":28,"beat":